ltivation Structure","groupsTitle":"Six Teaching Cultivation Groups","heroTag":"Rooted in faculty cultivation — weaving together curriculum, assessment, appointments and recognition to build a hospital-wide culture of teaching excellence.","heroTitle":"Cultivating every outstanding clinical teacher","kpis":[{"color":"#A87A6B","delay":0,"en":"Seed Teachers","label":"Seed Teachers","num":102,"suffix":""},{"color":"#7A95A8","delay":70,"en":"Joint Appointments","label":"Joint Appointments","num":125,"suffix":""},{"color":"#8FA898","delay":140,"en":"New Appointments (AY114)","label":"New Appointments (AY114)","num":6,"suffix":""},{"color":"#B69B66","delay":210,"en":"Cultivation Groups","label":"Cultivation Groups","num":6,"suffix":""}],"membersTitle":"Center Members","newsEyebrow":"Announcements","newsTitle":"Latest News","reservedNote":"This space is reserved for the center’s latest news and activities. Once linked to the activity-management platform, the public board’s announcements will appear here automatically.","reservedTag":"Coming soon","services":[{"desc":"Systematic, tiered faculty-training curricula aligned with JCT standards and hospital accreditation, covering clinical teachers across Western medicine, TCM, dentistry and all allied-health roles.","icon":"cap","title":"Hospital-wide Faculty Development & Training","tone":"#A87A6B"},{"desc":"Guiding clinical staff through TMU academic-appointment and promotion applications — eligibility advice, document review and process support that bridges clinical service and scholarship.","icon":"award","title":"Academic Appointment & Promotion","tone":"#7A95A8"},{"desc":"Monthly teaching journal clubs deepen pedagogical exchange; annual Outstanding Teacher and Teaching Innovation awards celebrate excellence and nurture a teaching-valued culture.","icon":"bulb","title":"Teaching Journal Club & Awards","tone":"#B69B66"},{"desc":"Quarterly committee meetings track faculty-training completion across the hospital, review overall teaching effectiveness, and iteratively refine development strategy.","icon":"clipboard","title":"Faculty Development Committee","tone":"#8FA898"}],"servicesDesc":"From training and appointments to journal clubs and committee oversight — supporting clinical teachers at every step.","servicesEyebrow":"Core Services","servicesTitle":"Four Core Services"},"zh":{"aboutBody":"教師發展中心隸屬於教學部，由陳明德主任帶領團隊，負責全院臨床教師的培育與學校教職相關事務，以系統性課程、評鑑遵循與委員會機制，持續提升整體教學品質與師資專業發展。","aboutBody2":"下設六大教學培育小組，串連 CBME、永續韌性、科技教學、實證醫學與全人照護，讓教學專業在各領域生根。","aboutEyebrow":"中心定位與使命","aboutTitle":"以教師發展，成就醫學教育","actEyebrow":"Activities","actTitle":"近期活動","closingBody":"教師發展中心以系統性培育、教職支持與六大小組協作，陸續協助全院跨職類教師成長，為醫學教育的永續發展扎下深厚根基。","closingTitle":"好的教師，是醫學教育最深的根基","colors":{"blue":"#7A95A8","clay":"#A87A6B","claySoft":"#C49A8C","ink":"#3A2E25","ochre":"#B69B66","sage":"#8FA898"},"contactExt":"(02) 2737-2181 ＃3757","contactPerson":"行政專員：陳均茹","contactPlace":"臺北醫學大學附設醫院 · 教學部 教師發展中心","contactQuote":"成就教師，就是成就每一位未來的醫療人才。","eyebrow":"Center for Faculty Development","groupLeadLabel":"負責人","groupRoot":"教師發展中心","groups":[{"desc":"規劃以勝任能力為導向（CBME）的課程設計與里程碑架構。","lead":{"alternateName":"Hsin-Yi Chiu","department":"西醫 · 助理教授","duty":"","email":"","ext":"","hubId":"hsin-yi-chiu","name":"邱欣怡","portrait":{"kind":"local","path":"assets/hsin-yi-chiu.jpg"},"role":"負責人","roleKey":"lead","slug":"hsin-yi-chiu"},"name":"CBME–課程組","tone":"#A87A6B"},{"desc":"發展 Mini-CEX、DOPS、CbD 等評量工具與 EPA 信效度分析。","lead":{"alternateName":"Jeng-Cheng Wu","department":"西醫 · 助理教授","duty":"","email":"","ext":"","hubId":"jeng-cheng-wu","name":"吳政誠","portrait":{"kind":"local","path":"assets/jeng-cheng-wu.jpg"},"role":"負責人","roleKey":"lead","slug":"jeng-cheng-wu"},"name":"CBME–評量組","tone":"#7A95A8"},{"desc":"推動教師身心永續與職場韌性，深化教學熱情與職涯發展。","lead":{"alternateName":"Chien-Yu Chen","department":"西醫 · 教授","duty":"","email":"","ext":"","hubId":"chien-yu-chen","name":"陳建宇","portrait":{"kind":"local","path":"assets/chien-yu-chen.jpg"},"role":"負責人","roleKey":"lead","s