","tone":"#7A95A8"},{"desc":"每月舉辦教學讀書會，深化教學知能交流；每年辦理「優良教師獎」與「教學創新獎」評選，表揚卓越教學與創新教法，營造重視教學的院內文化。","icon":"bulb","title":"教學讀書會與獎項評選","tone":"#B69B66"},{"desc":"每季召開一次委員會，追蹤全院臨床教師培訓完成狀況，檢視醫院整體教學成效，並據以滾動修正師資發展策略。","icon":"clipboard","title":"教師發展委員會","tone":"#8FA898"}],"servicesDesc":"從培訓、教職、讀書會到委員會，全方位支援臨床教師的專業成長。","servicesEyebrow":"中心核心業務","servicesTitle":"四大核心業務"}}'::jsonb, '2026-08-14T00:00:00.000Z'::timestamptz),
  ('e3d99a22-f8ef-5171-9410-ef3374941e4f', '80ea9361-937d-560d-80c4-709c0710d05b', 1, 'published', '{"en":{"aboutBody":"Within the Department of Medical Education, Director Hsiu-Chen Lin leads a multi-pronged strategy — from contests and quality-improvement projects to systematic training — building a complete, sustainable evidence-based medicine system.","aboutBody2":"Cultivating in-house EBM talent, driving cross-disciplinary collaboration, and repeatedly excelling at national healthcare-quality competitions.","aboutEyebrow":"Mission & Positioning","aboutTitle":"Evidence at the core, two decades deep","awardsClin":[{"award":"Potential","note":"","sess":"10th","tone":"#6E8A77"},{"award":"Gold","note":"Mesh fixation improvement in TEP inguinal hernia repair","sess":"Special","tone":"#B0894B"},{"award":"Potential","note":"Prophylactic steroids to reduce post-anesthesia nausea & vomiting","sess":"12th","tone":"#6E8A77"}],"awardsClinTitle":"Clinical Application Track","awardsDesc":"Sustained investment in the NHQA EBM category — standout results in the literature-appraisal and clinical-application tracks, and from AY113 also competing in the knowledge-translation track.","awardsEyebrow":"NHQA / NCMEA Achievements","awardsLit":[{"award":"Silver","sess":"7th","tone":"#9AA0A6"},{"award":"Potential","sess":"14th · 15th","tone":"#6E8A77"},{"award":"Gold","sess":"16th · 21st","tone":"#B0894B"},{"award":"15-yr Sustained","sess":"22nd","tone":"#5E7A8C"}],"awardsLitTitle":"Literature Appraisal Track","awardsTitle":"A Record of Distinction","awardsTrans":[{"award":"Newly Joined","note":"Joined the NCMEA Knowledge-Translation track from AY113, opening a new dimension of evidence application.","sess":"From AY113","tone":"#7A95A8"},{"award":"Translation","note":"Built on the monthly knowledge-translation forum, turning evidence into clinical decisions.","sess":"Focus","tone":"#6E8A77"}],"awardsTransTitle":"Knowledge Translation Track","closingBody":"Over two decades the Center has built a complete EBM system — from training and contests to quality improvement — continually striving to deliver the best care for patients.","closingTitle":"Making evidence the foundation of every clinical decision","colAward":"Award","colors":{"blue":"#5E7A8C","gold":"#B0894B","goldSoft":"#C4A268","ink":"#26303B"},"colSession":"Session","contactExt":"(02) 2737-2181 ext. 3760","contactPerson":"Administrator: Ming-Hsien Chiang","contactPlace":"TMU Hospital · EBM Center, Dept. of Medical Education","contactQuote":"Deepening care quality through evidence — the best evidence at every bedside.","courseGroups":[{"color":"#B0894B","gicon":"chart","rows":[{"detail":"Monthly · year-round","name":"Meta-analysis course series"},{"detail":"Feb–Apr each year","name":"Literature appraisal (Beginner)"},{"detail":"May–Jul each year","name":"Literature appraisal (Advanced)"}],"title":"Systematic Courses"},{"color":"#5E7A8C","gicon":"skills","rows":[{"detail":"Once a year · hands-on","name":"In-hospital appraisal contest"},{"detail":"Monthly","name":"Knowledge-translation forum"},{"detail":"Periodically","name":"Other related courses"}],"title":"Application & Practice"},{"color":"#6E8A77","gicon":"cap","rows":[{"detail":"3–4 sessions/year","name":"Seed-teacher training"},{"detail":"Systematic management","name":"Teaching talent pool"},{"detail":"Long-term program","name":"Future EBM leaders"}],"title":"Faculty Cultivation"}],"coursesDesc":"A systematic, stepwise design that moves from basics to advanced application, embedding EBM into daily clinical practice.","coursesEyebrow":"Annual Training Program","coursesTitle":"A Stepwise Curriculum","eyebrow":"Center for Evidence-Based Medicine","heroTag":"Anchored in evidence to lead clinical practice, raise care quality and create the best patient outcomes — advancing a hospital-wide culture of evidence-based medicine.","heroTitle":"The key engine for better care quality","journeyDesc":"From its founding in 2004, three phases of sustained effort have built a complete in-hospital EBM ecosystem.","journeyEyebrow":"Twenty Years of Progress","journeyTitle":"Our Journey","kpis":[{"color":"#B0894B","delay":0,"en":"Years since 2004","label":"Years since 2004","num":20,"suffix":"+"},{"color":"#5E7A8C","delay":70,"en":"Core Missions","label":"Core Missions","num":4,"suffix":""},{"color":"#6E8A77","delay":140,"en":"Years at NHQA","label":"Years at NHQA","num":15,"suffix":"+"},{"color":"#A87A6B","delay":210,"en":"Contest Tracks","label":"Contest Tracks","num":3,"suffix":""}],"membersTitle":"Center Members","missions":[{"desc":"Competing in the National Healthcare Quality Award (NHQA) EBM category — Gold and Potential Awards in 2020, and a 15-year Sustained Participation Award in 2021.","tag":"01","title":"NHQA / NCMEA EBM Contest"},{"desc":"Encouraging staff across all disciplines to submit papers, fostering academic exchange and raising the hospital’s visibility in evidence-based medicine.","tag":"02","title":"EBM Conference Submissions"},{"desc":"Evidence-Based Quality Improvement (EBQI) turns clinical problems into solutions across departments, translating research evidence into real quality gains.","tag":"03","title":"EBQI Quality Improvement"},{"desc":"Multi-level EBM training from beginner to advanced, with literature-search courses run alongside the library and information department.","tag":"04","title":"EBM Education & Training"}],"missionsDesc":"Clearly divided yet mutually supportive, together raising the hospital’s evidence-based medicine capacity.","missionsEyebrow":"Organizational Mandate","missionsTitle":"Four Core Missions","stages":[{"color":"#B0894B","items":["Founded the EBM Center and its hospital-wide framework","Tailored courses for residents (R), PGY, UGY and allied health","Regular EBM Journal Club to build a clinical-discussion culture","Clinical-based PBL-EBM integrated curriculum"],"name":"Foundation","phase":"Phase 1","years":"2004–2014"},{"color":"#5E7A8C","items":["Co-hosted the TMU system one-university-three-hospital EBM contest","Held in-hospital contest result presentations","Active in the Taiwan EBM Association; elected to its board","Assisted the JCT in running literature-appraisal contests"],"name":"Expansion","phase":"Phase 2","years":"2015–2018"},{"color":"#6E8A77","items":["2019 “EBM Teaching & Clinical Application” showcase","Annual EBM competency contests, 2022–2024","Ongoing participation in international EBM activities","Establishing the Cochrane Taiwan university research center"],"name":"Deepening","phase":"Phase 3","years":"2019–Present"}]},"zh":{"aboutBody":"本中心隸屬於教學部，由林秀真主任帶領專業團隊，採多管齊下策略推動院內實證醫學文化：從競賽參與、品質改善專案到系統性教育培訓，建立起完整且可持續的發展體系。","aboutBody2":"長期致力於培育院內實證醫學專業人才，積極推動跨領域合作，並於國家級醫療品質競賽中屢創佳績。","aboutEyebrow":"中心定位與核心使命","aboutTitle":"實證為基，深耕二十餘載","awardsClin":[{"award":"潛力獎","note":"","sess":"第 10 屆","tone":"#6E8A77"},{"award":"金獎","note":"全腹膜外內視鏡腹股溝痝氣修補手術之人工網膌固定改善專案","sess":"特別獎項","tone":"#B0894B"},{"award":"潛力獎","note":"預防性投與類固醇以改善全身麻醉手術後之冑心嘔吐專案","sess":"第 12 屆","tone":"#6E8A77"}],"awardsClinTitle":"臨床應用組","awardsDesc":"長期投入國家醫療品質獎實證醫學類競賽，於文獻查證組與臨床應用組均有亮眼成績，並自 113 學年度起參與知識轉譯組，持續拓展實證應用面向。","awardsEyebrow":"NHQA（現為 NCMEA）實證醫學競賽","awardsLit":[{"award":"銀獎","sess":"第 7 屆","tone":"#9AA0A6"},{"award":"潛力獎","sess":"第 14 ・15 屆","tone":"#6E8A77"},{"award":"金獎","sess":"第 16 ・21 屆","tone":"#B0894B"},{"award":"15 年以上持續參與特別獎","sess":"第 22 屆","tone":"#5E7A8C"}],"awardsLitTitle":"文獻查證組","awardsTitle":"競賽輝煌成就","awardsTrans":[{"award":"新增參與","note":"自 113 學年度起參與 NCMEA 知識轉譯組競賽，拓展實證應用新面向。","sess":"113 學年起","tone":"#7A95A8"},{"award":"證據轉化","note":"以每月「實證醫學知識轉譯討論會」為基礎，推動證據轉化為臨床決策。","sess":"推動重點","tone":"#6E8A77"}],"awardsTransTitle":"知識轉譯組","closingBody":"教學部實證醫學中心歷經二十餘年耕耘，已在本院建立起完整的實證醫學推動體系。從教育培訓、競賽參與到品質改善，持續為病患提供最佳照護品質。","closingTitle":"讓實證成為每一次臨床決策的基石","colAward":"獲獎紀錄","colors":{"blue":"#5E7A8C","gold":"#B0894B","goldSoft":"#C4A268","ink":"#26303B"},"colSession":"屆別","contactExt":"(02) 2737-2181 ＃3760","contactPerson":"行政專員：江明憲","contactPlace":"臺北醫學大學附設醫院 · 教學部 實證醫學中心","contactQuote":"以實證深耕醫療品質，讓最佳證據走進每一個臨床現場。","courseGroups":[{"color":"#B0894B","gicon":"chart","rows":[{"detail":"每月 1 堂・全年持續","name":"實證醫學 Meta-analysis 帶狀課程"},{"detail":"每年 2–4 月・奠定基礎","name":"文獻查證培訓班（初階）"},{"detail":"每年 5–7 月・進階分析","name":"文獻查證培訓班（進階）"}],"title":"系統性課程"},{"color":"#5E7A8C","gicon":"skills","rows":[{"detail":"每年 1 次・實戰演練","name":"文獻查證院內競賽"},{"detail":"每月 1 次・證據轉化","name":"實證知識轉譯討論會"},{"detail":"每年不定期舉辦","name":"其他相關課程"}],"title":"應用與實踐"},{"color":"#6E8A77","gicon":"cap","rows":[{"detail":"每年 3–4 堂","name":"實證醫學種子師資培訓課程"},{"detail":"系統性管理","name":"院內實證教學人才庫"},{"detail":"長期培育計畫","name":"培養未來實證領導者"}],"title":"師資培育"}],"coursesDesc":"依循「系統性、階梯式」設計原則，由淺入深，將實證醫學能力落實於日常臨床實務。","coursesEyebrow":"實證中心年度訓練課程","coursesTitle":"階梯式訓練體系","eyebrow":"Center for Evidence-Based Medicine","heroTag":"以「實證為基礎，引領臨床實踐，提升醫療品質，創造最佳病患照護」為核心使命，推動院內實證醫學文化。","heroTitle":"提升醫療品質的關鍵引擎","journeyDesc":"自民國 93 年創立至今，歷經三個階段的持續耕耘，逐步建立完整的院內實證醫學生態系統。","journeyEyebrow":"二十年的卓越發展","journeyTitle":"實證醫學推動歷程","kpis":[{"color":"#B0894B","delay":0,"en":"Years since 2004","label":"年實證深耕","num":20,"suffix":"+"},{"color":"#5E7A8C","delay":70,"en":"Core Missions","label":"大核心任務","num":4,"suffix":""},{"color":"#6E8A77","delay":140,"en":"Years at NHQA","label":"年 NHQA 持續參與","num":15,"suffix":"+"},{"color":"#A87A6B","delay":210,"en":"Contest Tracks","label":"大競賽組別","num":3,"suffix":""}],"membersTitle":"中心成員","missions":[{"desc":"積極參與國家醫療品質獎（NHQA）實證醫學類競賽，自民國 109 年榮獲金獎及潛力獎，110 年更獲頒「持續參與特別獎（15 年）」。","tag":"01","title":"NHQA（現為 NCMEA）實證醫學競賽"},{"desc":"鼓勵全院各職類醫療人員共同參與論文投稿，促進院內外學術交流，提升實證醫學領域的能見度與影響力。","tag":"02","title":"實證醫學研討會投稿"},{"desc":"導入「實證醫學改善醫療品質方案（EBQI）」，跨領域發掘臨床問題，透過實證方法將研究證據轉化為實際的醫療品質改善行動。","tag":"03","title":"EBQI 品質改善專案"},{"desc":"定期辦理多層次實證醫學能力培訓課程，涵蓋初階至進階，並與圖書館資訊部門合作辦理文獻檢索課程。","tag":"04","title":"實證醫學教育培訓"}],"missionsDesc":"分工明確、相互支援，共同推動全院實證醫學能量的提升。","missionsEyebrow":"組織任務架構","missionsTitle":"四大核心任務","stages":[{"color":"#B0894B","items":["正式成立實證醫學中心，制定院內推動制度架構","針對 R、PGY、UGY 及各類醫事人員開設適切課程","定期舉辦 EBM Journal Club，建立臨床討論文化","推動 Clinical based–PBL–EBM 整合課程"],"name":"奠基階段","phase":"第一階段","years":"民國 93–103 年"},{"color":"#5E7A8C","items":["首度協辦「北醫體系一校三院實證醫學競賽」","辦理院內競賽成果發表會","參與臺灣實證醫學學會，由院內人員遮選為理監事","協助醫策會舉辦文獻查證競賽"],"name":"擴展階段","phase":"第二階段","years":"民國 104–107 年"},{"color":"#6E8A77","items":["108 年舉辦「實證教學與臨床應用發表會」","111–113 年每年舉辦實證醫學能力競賽暨成果發表會","持續參與國際實證醫學學術活動","籌設「臺北醫學大學考科藍臺灣校級研究中心」"],"name":"深化階段","phase":"第三階段","years":"民國 108–至今"}]}}'::jsonb, '2026-08-14T00:00:00.000Z'::timestamptz),
  ('5f66bde7-a636-5938-93cf-b5aa0fab5910', '8492f301-aca2-5d4f-8d3d-a25a95cbf72a', 1, 'published', '{"en":{"aiEcosystem":{"body":"The core is not a single tool but a teaching-simulation ecosystem for repeated practice, instant feedback and an accumulating case library — connecting AI patients, AI-authored cases, tablet & VR simulation, holistic learning feedback and a Line AI ChatBot assistant.","flow":[{"color":"#4f8c7d","role":"Faculty","text":"Turn holistic-care goals, clinical tasks and discussion prompts into interactive case scenarios.","title":"AI-authored cases"},{"color":"#6E8A77","role":"Scenario","text":"Cases designed across medical, humanistic, psychological, ethical and care contexts.","title":"Whole-person clinical context"},{"color":"#B69B66","role":"Feedback","text":"Learning-process feedback plus an on-the-go holistic clinical assistant for after-class study.","title":"AI Instant Feedback"}],"problems":["Make holistic care operational, practiceable and measurable — not just an ideal.","Let students rehearse history-taking, judgment, communication and treatment with AI patients before real clinics.","Help faculty rapidly produce case scenarios and refine courses through learning-outcome feedback."],"problemsTitle":"What does the ecosystem solve?","teamLabel":"Healthy Taiwan Deep Cultivation Program · Scope 2 Team","title":"AI Holistic-Care Teaching Simulation Ecosystem"},"algee":[{"description":"Reach out with care, watch for signs of self-harm or crisis, and step in safely when needed.","letter":"A","title":"Approach, assess & assist"},{"description":"Set judgment aside and offer a safe, understanding space so the person feels heard.","letter":"L","title":"Listen non-judgmentally"},{"description":"Share accurate, practical mental-health information alongside understanding and support.","letter":"G","title":"Give support & information"},{"description":"Help the person connect with medical and professional resources, and take the first step.","letter":"E","title":"Encourage professional help"},{"description":"Draw on family, peer and community networks so support continues over time.","letter":"E","title":"Encourage other supports"}],"features":[{"delay":0,"desc":"Bringing together nursing, medicine, pharmacy, social work, psychology and more to root a culture of care.","iconId":"sprout","title":"Seed Teacher Cultivation"},{"delay":100,"desc":"Linking clinical units and campus resources into a supportive, responsive, healthy workplace.","iconId":"network","title":"Cross-Department Collaboration"},{"delay":200,"desc":"A dedicated cross-professional team — uniting Western medicine, TCM, dentistry and all allied-health roles — to co-develop holistic-care teaching cases and curricula across every discipline.","iconId":"team","title":"Holistic Education Working Group"}],"kpis":[{"color":"#6E8A77","display":"","isStatic":false,"label":"AY113 Seed Teachers","num":87,"subtitle":"Physicians 40 · Allied 14 · Nursing 33"},{"color":"#4f8c7d","display":"","isStatic":false,"label":"Holistic Seed Teachers (total)","num":133},{"color":"#5E7A8C","display":"2 / 11","isStatic":true,"label":"MHFA Instructors / Seed Teachers","num":0},{"color":"#A87A6B","display":"","isStatic":false,"label":"Hospital-Wide Holistic Research","num":94,"subtitle":"2019–2025 · incl. 10 on education"}],"outcomes":{"attendeesLabel":"attendees","hostLabel":"Hosted by Medical Education","satisfactionLabel":"Satisfaction","symposiumDesc":"Department-hosted symposia and forums on holistic care, spiritual care and resilience. Scale varies with each year’s topic and format, so attendance is not directly comparable across years.","symposiumEyebrow":"Symposia","symposiums":[{"attendees":382,"dates":"Sat 2021/12/04","edition":"1st","satisfaction":4.52,"time":"08:00–17:00","title":"International Symposium on Spiritual Care","year":2021},{"attendees":916,"dates":"Sat–Sun 2022/12/03–04","edition":"2nd","satisfaction":4.75,"time":"08:00–17:00 / 08:00–12:00","title":"Holistic Medicine — Spiritual Care International Symposium","year":2022},{"attendees":165,"dates":"Sun 2023/04/30","edition":"1st","satisfaction":4.88,"time":"10:00–16:00","title":"International Resilience Symposium","year":2023},{"dates":"2024/06/15","edition":"AY113","time":"08:30–12:30","title":"Holistic Care Core Competency Symposium","year":2024}],"symposiumTitle":"Holistic Symposia & Forums","trainingDesc":"Summary of seed-teacher cultivation and in-house faculty training outcomes.","trainingEyebrow":"Faculty Training","trainingParticipants":{"label":"Participants","num":1482},"trainingSatisfaction":{"label":"Overall Satisfaction","num":4.75,"suffix":"/5"},"trainingSessions":{"label":"Sessions","num":7},"trainingTitle":"AY113 Holistic Care Faculty Training"}},"zh":{"aiEcosystem":{"body":"本計畫的核心不是單一工具，而是一個可以反覆練習、即時回饋、持續累積案例的教學模擬生態系。以全人臨床情境為主軸，串接 AI 病人、教案 AI 化、平板與 VR 模擬練習、全人學習成效回饋，以及 Line AI ChatBot 隨身助教，讓教師設計情境、學生進入情境，AI 協助互動與回饋。","flow":[{"color":"#4f8c7d","role":"教師端","text":"把全人照護目標、臨床任務與討論問題轉成可互動的情境教案。","title":"教案 AI 化"},{"color":"#6E8A77","role":"情境內容","text":"以醫學、人文、心理、倫理與照護脈絡設計案例。","title":"全人臨床情境"},{"color":"#B69B66","role":"回饋端","text":"提供學習歷程回饋與全人臨床隨身助教，支援課後延伸學習。","title":"AI即時回饋"}],"problems":["讓全人照護不只停留在理念，而是變成可操作、可練習、可回饋的教學流程。","讓學生在進入真實臨床前，先透過 AI 病人練習問診、判斷、溝通與治療計畫。","讓教師能快速產出情境教案，並透過學習成效回饋持續修正課程。"],"problemsTitle":"生態系要解決什麼問題？","teamLabel":"健康台灣深耕計劃範疇二團隊","title":"AI 全人照護教學模擬生態系"},"algee":[{"description":"主動關懷，留意潛在的自傷或危機徵兆，在安全前提下評估狀況並適時介入。","letter":"A","title":"接近、評估與協助危機"},{"description":"放下評價，給予一個安全、被理解的傾訴空間，讓對方願意說出感受。","letter":"L","title":"不帶批判地聆聽"},{"description":"提供正確、實用的身心健康資訊，並表達理解與支持。","letter":"G","title":"給予支持與資訊"},{"description":"協助對方連結醫療與專業資源，跨出求助的第一步。","letter":"E","title":"鼓勵尋求專業協助"},{"description":"善用家庭、同儕與社區的支持網絡，讓關懷持續發生。","letter":"E","title":"鼓勵其他支持"}],"features":[{"delay":0,"desc":"集結護理、醫師、藥劑、社工、心理、語言治療等跨領域人才，將關懷文化向下扎根。","iconId":"sprout","title":"種子教師培育"},{"delay":100,"desc":"串連臨床各單位與校園資源，打造彼此支持、能即時伸出援手的健康職場。","iconId":"network","title":"跨科部協作"},{"delay":200,"desc":"跨越西醫、中醫、牙醫與各醫事職類，組成專責團隊，共同鑽研全人照護教案設計與教學發展，讓全人精神在每個專業領域生根。","iconId":"team","title":"全人教育小組"}],"kpis":[{"color":"#6E8A77","display":"","isStatic":false,"label":"113 學年種子教師","num":87,"subtitle":"醫師 40 · 醫事 14 · 護理 33"},{"color":"#4f8c7d","display":"","isStatic":false,"label":"全人種子教師（累計）","num":133},{"color":"#5E7A8C","display":"2 / 11","isStatic":true,"label":"MHFA 指導員／種子教師","num":0},{"color":"#A87A6B","display":"","isStatic":false,"label":"全院全人相關研究論文","num":94,"subtitle":"2019–2025 · 含 10 篇全人照護教育"}],"outcomes":{"attendeesLabel":"人","hostLabel":"教學部主辦","satisfactionLabel":"滿意度","symposiumDesc":"教學部主辦之全人照護、靈性關懷與韌性相關研討會與論壇；活動規模依年度主題與形式調整，參與人數不宜直接跨年度比較。","symposiumEyebrow":"Symposia","symposiums":[{"attendees":382,"dates":"2021/12/04（六）","edition":"第一屆","satisfaction":4.52,"time":"08:00–17:00","title":"靈性關懷國際研討會","year":2021},{"attendees":916,"dates":"2022/12/03（六）– 12/04（日）","edition":"第二屆","satisfaction":4.75,"time":"08:00–17:00 / 08:00–12:00","title":"全人醫療—靈性關懷國際研討會","year":2022},{"attendees":165,"dates":"2023/04/30（日）","edition":"第一屆","satisfaction":4.88,"time":"10:00–16:00","title":"韌性國際研討會","year":2023},{"dates":"2024/06/15","edition":"113 學年","time":"08:30–12:30","title":"全人照護核心能力研討會","year":2024}],"symposiumTitle":"全人研討會＆論壇","trainingDesc":"全人照護種子教師培育與院內師資培訓成果摘要。","trainingEyebrow":"Faculty Training","trainingParticipants":{"label":"人次","num":1482},"trainingSatisfaction":{"label":"整體滿意度","num":4.75,"suffix":"/5"},"trainingSessions":{"label":"場訓練","num":7},"trainingTitle":"113 學年全人照護師培課程"}}}'::jsonb, '2026-08-14T00:00:00.000Z'::timestamptz),
